    <string name="memory_confirm_force_stop_message">Unsaved work may be lost. Until it is opened again, the app will not show notifications, run alarms or sync. Android may restart some apps on its own. This does not save battery by itself.</string>
    <string name="memory_confirm_kill_message">Android ends only the processes it can safely end; the app can start again whenever it needs to. Notifications are not blocked.</string>

